# Everything the build context does not need. Keeping build output out is not only about size:
# a copied obj/ folder carries absolute paths and a project.assets.json from the host machine,
# which makes the restore inside the image disagree with the one outside it.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/TestResults/
**/.vs/
.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
artifacts/
docs/
tests/
tools/
src/AppHost/
**/*.user
**/local.settings.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
README*.md
CLAUDE.md
